290
00:28:43,856 --> 00:28:49,216
And so the way you can actually align the model to your task is by converting that zero shot prompt.

291
00:28:49,456 --> 00:29:01,572
Zero shot refers to the fact that it's not beginning given any example into a few short prompts where the model is given in the prompt a set of examples to align it to what you want it to do.

