00:36:51,248 --> 00:36:58,128
So the outline is exactly what I want the LLM to do, but the translation in a customer facing email is not good.

365
00:36:58,288 --> 00:37:05,168
In fact, it doesn't follow our vocabulary internally, then I know the third prompt is where I would get the most gains.

366
00:37:06,094 --> 00:37:09,284
So that's what it allows me to do have intermediate steps to review.

